# SmartClass

A software-only smart classroom simulation built with Node.js,
Express, SQLite, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Requirements

- Node.js 18 or newer
- npm

## Installation

1. Open a terminal in the SmartClass folder.
2. Install dependencies:

   npm install

3. Start the application:

   npm start

4. Open http://localhost:3000

## Features

- Simulated temperature, humidity, lighting, and occupancy
- Configurable automation thresholds
- Virtual lights, fan, and AC controls
- Saved sensor readings and history chart
- Scenario presets
- Attendance QR session demo
- JSON report export
- SQLite database persistence
- Backend health endpoint

## API

- GET /api/health
- GET /api/settings
- POST /api/settings
- GET /api/readings
- POST /api/readings
- GET /api/readings/latest
- GET /api/devices
- POST /api/devices/:device
- GET /api/activity
- DELETE /api/activity

## Notes

The devices and sensor values are simulated. No physical IoT
hardware is connected. QR code generation uses a CDN library
and requires an internet connection.